  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 4204.04 Waiver of Penalties or Interest.\n\n(a) Any licensee may submit to the bureau, in writing, a request for a waiver of penalties or interest assessed under the provisions of RSA 146-A:11-b, based upon the criteria in Odb 209\n\n(b) The bureau shall forward any request for a waiver to the oil fund disbursement board for action as specified in RSA 146-A:11-b, IV.\n\nSource. #7348, eff 8-22-00, EXPIRED: 8-22-08\n\nNew. #9375, eff 1-30-09; ss by #10025, eff 11-16-11, EXPIRED: 11-16-19\n\nNew. #13019, eff 4-7-20",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c4200.html"
